# Build / Compile

- Do **not** run `pio run`, `pio run -t clean`, or other PlatformIO compile/upload/monitor commands on your own after code changes.
- Leave building and flashing to the user.
- Only run a build when the user explicitly asks (e.g. „baue“, „compile“, `pio run`).
- After edits, briefly note what changed; do not verify by compiling unless requested.
